          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingRegressor\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(3112)\nn = 1600\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Scikit-Learn 1.9: Backdoor Adjustment (G-Comp, IPW & AIPW) vs Bad Control\n# Promo gratis ongkir biner T in {0,1} dengan confounder non-linier X dan\n# collider pasca-perlakuan C_post (skor interaksi layanan pelanggan pasca-promo).\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, 3))\nlogits = 0.85 * X[:, 0] - 0.65 * X[:, 1] + 0.35 * X[:, 0] * X[:, 1]\ne_true = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-logits))\nT = rng.binomial(1, e_true)\n\nmu0_true = 10.0 + 3.0 * np.sin(X[:, 0]) + 2.2 * X[:, 1] + 1.4 * (X[:, 2] ** 2)\ntau_i_true = 4.0 + 0.8 * X[:, 0]\nY0 = mu0_true + rng.normal(0.0, 1.1, size=n)\nY1 = Y0 + tau_i_true\nY = np.where(T == 1, Y1, Y0)\ntrue_ate = float(np.mean(tau_i_true))\n\n# Collider pasca-perlakuan: dipengaruhi oleh T DAN Y!\nC_post = 2.0 * T + 0.7 * Y + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n\nate_naive = float(Y[T == 1].mean() - Y[T == 0].mean())\n\n# 1. Backdoor G-Computation murni pada Backdoor Set X pra-perlakuan\nreg_clean = HistGradientBoostingRegressor(max_depth=4, max_iter=45, max_bins=64, random_state=42)\nreg_clean.fit(np.column_stack([X, T]), Y)\nmu1_hat = reg_clean.predict(np.column_stack([X, np.ones(n)]))\nmu0_hat = reg_clean.predict(np.column_stack([X, np.zeros(n)]))\nate_gcomp = float(np.mean(mu1_hat - mu0_hat))\n\n# 2. Propensity Weighting (IPW) & Doubly Robust (AIPW) pada X murni\nX_prop = np.column_stack([X, X[:, 0] * X[:, 1]])\nprop_clf = LogisticRegression(max_iter=300).fit(X_prop, T)\ne_hat = np.clip(prop_clf.predict_proba(X_prop)[:, 1], 0.05, 0.95)\nate_ipw = float(np.mean(T * Y / e_hat - (1 - T) * Y / (1.0 - e_hat)))\nate_aipw = float(np.mean(\n    (mu1_hat - mu0_hat)\n    + T * (Y - mu1_hat) / e_hat\n    - (1 - T) * (Y - mu0_hat) / (1.0 - e_hat)\n))\n\n# 3. BAD CONTROL: Memasukkan collider pasca-perlakuan C_post ke G-Computation!\nreg_bad = HistGradientBoostingRegressor(max_depth=4, max_iter=45, max_bins=64, random_state=42)\nreg_bad.fit(np.column_stack([X, C_post, T]), Y)\nate_bad_collider = float(np.mean(\n    reg_bad.predict(np.column_stack([X, C_post, np.ones(n)]))\n    - reg_bad.predict(np.column_stack([X, C_post, np.zeros(n)]))\n))\n\nprint(f\"=== Backdoor Adjustment vs Bad Control (N={n}, True ATE = +{true_ate:.4f}) ===\")\nfor name, val in [\n    (\"Naif Difference-in-Means (Bias Confounder)\", ate_naive),\n    (\"Backdoor G-Computation (HistGBDT di X)   \", ate_gcomp),\n    (\"Backdoor IPW (Propensity Weighting di X) \", ate_ipw),\n    (\"Backdoor AIPW / Doubly Robust (X murni)  \", ate_aipw),\n    (\"BAD CONTROL G-Comp (X + Collider C_post!)\", ate_bad_collider),\n]:\n    print(f\"{name} | ATE_hat = {val:+.4f} | Err = {val - true_ate:+.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Backdoor Adjustment vs Bad Control (N=1600, True ATE = +4.0102) ===\nNaif Difference-in-Means (Bias Confounder) | ATE_hat = +4.5483 | Err = +0.5381\nBackdoor G-Computation (HistGBDT di X)    | ATE_hat = +3.6149 | Err = -0.3953\nBackdoor IPW (Propensity Weighting di X)  | ATE_hat = +4.3929 | Err = +0.3827\nBackdoor AIPW / Doubly Robust (X murni)   | ATE_hat = +3.9233 | Err = -0.0869\nBAD CONTROL G-Comp (X + Collider C_post!) | ATE_hat = -0.3525 | Err = -4.3627",
          "actualOutput": "=== Backdoor Adjustment vs Bad Control (N=1600, True ATE = +4.0102) ===\nNaif Difference-in-Means (Bias Confounder) | ATE_hat = +4.5483 | Err = +0.5381\nBackdoor G-Computation (HistGBDT di X)    | ATE_hat = +3.6149 | Err = -0.3953\nBackdoor IPW (Propensity Weighting di X)  | ATE_hat = +4.3929 | Err = +0.3827\nBackdoor AIPW / Doubly Robust (X murni)   | ATE_hat = +3.9233 | Err = -0.0869\nBAD CONTROL G-Comp (X + Collider C_post!) | ATE_hat = -0.3525 | Err = -4.3627",
