          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(3113)\nn = 4000\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Production Audit 1: Dualitas Simpson's Paradox — Data Sama, Keputusan Bergantung DAG!\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Skenario A (W = Confounder Keparahan): obat baru T=1 lebih sering diberi ke pasien parah W=1\nW_a = rng.binomial(1, 0.50, size=n)\nT_a = rng.binomial(1, np.where(W_a == 1, 0.80, 0.20))\nY_a = rng.binomial(1, np.clip(0.75 - 0.50 * W_a + 0.15 * T_a, 0.01, 0.99))\n\nagg_a = float(Y_a[T_a == 1].mean() - Y_a[T_a == 0].mean())\nstrat_a = float(sum(\n    np.mean(W_a == w) * (Y_a[(T_a == 1) & (W_a == w)].mean() - Y_a[(T_a == 0) & (W_a == w)].mean())\n    for w in [0, 1]\n))\n\n# Skenario B (W = Mediator Tekanan Darah): T -> W -> Y (total efek sejati = 0.60*0.35 - 0.05 = +0.16)\nT_b = rng.binomial(1, 0.50, size=n)\nW_b = rng.binomial(1, np.where(T_b == 1, 0.80, 0.20))\nY_b = rng.binomial(1, np.clip(0.35 + 0.35 * W_b - 0.05 * T_b, 0.01, 0.99))\n\nagg_b = float(Y_b[T_b == 1].mean() - Y_b[T_b == 0].mean())\nstrat_b = float(sum(\n    np.mean(W_b == w) * (Y_b[(T_b == 1) & (W_b == w)].mean() - Y_b[(T_b == 0) & (W_b == w)].mean())\n    for w in [0, 1]\n))\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Audit Dualitas Simpson's Paradox (Tanda Terbalik Agregat vs Strata!) ===\")\nprint(f\"Skenario A (W=Confounder, True=+0.150) | Agregat={agg_a:+.4f} (SALAH!) | Backdoor Strata={strat_a:+.4f} (BENAR!)\")\nprint(f\"Skenario B (W=Mediator,   True=+0.160) | Agregat={agg_b:+.4f} (BENAR!) | Kontrol Strata ={strat_b:+.4f} (SALAH!)\")\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Production Audit 2: Pelanggaran Positivity / Overlap & Effective Sample Size (ESS)\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nx_seg = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\ne_good = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-0.8 * x_seg))\ne_bad = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-3.8 * x_seg))\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Positivity / Overlap (Bobot IPW Maksimum & Effective Sample Size) ===\")\nfor name, e_vec in [(\"Overlap Sehat (logit=0.8x)\", e_good), (\"Overlap Rusak (logit=3.8x)\", e_bad)]:\n    t_sim = rng.binomial(1, e_vec)\n    w_ipw = np.where(t_sim == 1, 1.0 / e_vec, 1.0 / (1.0 - e_vec))\n    ess = float((np.sum(w_ipw) ** 2) / np.sum(w_ipw ** 2))\n    pct_ext = float(np.mean((e_vec < 0.05) | (e_vec > 0.95)))\n    print(f\"{name:28s} | Extreme(<5%/>95%)={pct_ext:6.2%} | MaxWeight={w_ipw.max():6.1f} | ESS={ess:6.1f}/{n}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Dualitas Simpson's Paradox (Tanda Terbalik Agregat vs Strata!) ===\nSkenario A (W=Confounder, True=+0.150) | Agregat=-0.1702 (SALAH!) | Backdoor Strata=+0.1180 (BENAR!)\nSkenario B (W=Mediator,   True=+0.160) | Agregat=+0.1945 (BENAR!) | Kontrol Strata =-0.0083 (SALAH!)\n\n=== 2. Audit Positivity / Overlap (Bobot IPW Maksimum & Effective Sample Size) ===\nOverlap Sehat (logit=0.8x)   | Extreme(<5%/>95%)= 0.00% | MaxWeight=  11.0 | ESS=3372.4/4000\nOverlap Rusak (logit=3.8x)   | Extreme(<5%/>95%)=43.60% | MaxWeight= 129.2 | ESS= 542.7/4000",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Audit Dualitas Simpson's Paradox (Tanda Terbalik Agregat vs Strata!) ===\nSkenario A (W=Confounder, True=+0.150) | Agregat=-0.1702 (SALAH!) | Backdoor Strata=+0.1180 (BENAR!)\nSkenario B (W=Mediator,   True=+0.160) | Agregat=+0.1945 (BENAR!) | Kontrol Strata =-0.0083 (SALAH!)\n\n=== 2. Audit Positivity / Overlap (Bobot IPW Maksimum & Effective Sample Size) ===\nOverlap Sehat (logit=0.8x)   | Extreme(<5%/>95%)= 0.00% | MaxWeight=  11.0 | ESS=3372.4/4000\nOverlap Rusak (logit=3.8x)   | Extreme(<5%/>95%)=43.60% | MaxWeight= 129.2 | ESS= 542.7/4000",
          "explanation": "Membuktikan dualitas Simpson's Paradox (ketika W=Confounder wajib pakai strata +0.118 vs agregat -0.170; ketika W=Mediator wajib pakai agregat +0.195 vs strata -0.008) serta audit pelanggaran Positivity yang menjatuhkan Effective Sample Size IPW dari 3372 ke 542 dari 4000 sampel.",
