          "filename": "31_2_dml_neyman_orthogonality_mc_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(312)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# First-Principles NumPy: Monte Carlo 80 Ulangan — Regularization Bias O(n^-1/4)\n# vs Neyman Orthogonality + 5-Fold Cross-Fitting O(n^-1/2) pada lambda IDENTIK!\n# Model Partially Linear:\n#   T = X @ beta_m + V,   Y = theta_0 * T + X @ beta_g + eps,  theta_0 = +2.00\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn, p, n_reps, lam = 500, 30, 80, 18.0\ntheta_true = 2.00\nbeta_m = np.zeros(p)\nbeta_g = np.zeros(p)\nbeta_m[:8] = np.linspace(1.1, 0.4, 8)\nbeta_g[:8] = np.linspace(1.3, 0.5, 8)\nI_p = np.eye(p)\n\ndef ridge_pred(X_tr: np.ndarray, y_tr: np.ndarray, X_te: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    w = np.linalg.solve(X_tr.T @ X_tr + lam * I_p, X_tr.T @ y_tr)\n    return X_te @ w\n\ndef dml_sandwich(y_res: np.ndarray, t_res: np.ndarray) -> tuple[float, float]:\n    denom = float(np.sum(t_res ** 2))\n    theta = float(np.sum(t_res * y_res) / denom)\n    se = float(np.sqrt(np.sum((t_res * (y_res - theta * t_res)) ** 2)) / denom)\n    return theta, se\n\nest_plug, est_nonorth, est_dml = [], [], []\ncov_plug = cov_nonorth = cov_dml = 0\n\nfor _ in range(n_reps):\n    X = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, p))\n    T = X @ beta_m + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n    Y = theta_true * T + X @ beta_g + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n\n    # 1. Direct Penalized Plug-in (Penalti lam pada X -> Regularization Bias O(n^-1/4)!)\n    Xt = np.column_stack([T, X])\n    P_pen = np.diag(np.r_[0.0, np.full(p, lam)])\n    coef_p = np.linalg.solve(Xt.T @ Xt + P_pen, Xt.T @ Y)\n    th_p = float(coef_p[0])\n    r_p = Y - Xt @ coef_p\n    se_p = float(np.sqrt(np.mean(r_p ** 2) * np.linalg.inv(Xt.T @ Xt + P_pen)[0, 0]))\n    est_plug.append(th_p)\n    cov_plug += int(abs(th_p - theta_true) <= 1.96 * se_p)\n\n    # 5-Fold Cross-Fitting untuk kedua nuisance m(X)=E[T|X] dan l(X)=E[Y|X]\n    y_res, t_res = np.empty(n), np.empty(n)\n    folds = np.array_split(np.arange(n), 5)\n    for k in range(5):\n        va = folds[k]\n        tr = np.concatenate([folds[j] for j in range(5) if j != k])\n        y_res[va] = Y[va] - ridge_pred(X[tr], Y[tr], X[va])\n        t_res[va] = T[va] - ridge_pred(X[tr], T[tr], X[va])\n\n    # 2. Non-Orthogonal (Hanya residualisasi Y, lupa partialling-out T -> Hancur!)\n    th_no, se_no = dml_sandwich(y_res, T)\n    est_nonorth.append(th_no)\n    cov_nonorth += int(abs(th_no - theta_true) <= 1.96 * se_no)\n\n    # 3. Partialling-Out DML Penuh (Neyman Orthogonal + 5-Fold Cross-Fitting!)\n    th_d, se_d = dml_sandwich(y_res, t_res)\n    est_dml.append(th_d)\n    cov_dml += int(abs(th_d - theta_true) <= 1.96 * se_d)\n\nprint(f\"=== Monte Carlo DML ({n_reps} Ulangan, n={n}, p={p}, lam={lam:.0f}, theta_true = +{theta_true:.2f}) ===\")\nfor label, vals, cov in [\n    (\"1. Direct Plug-in Ridge (Bias O(n^-1/4))\", est_plug, cov_plug),\n    (\"2. Non-Orthogonal (Y-res saja, tanpa T) \", est_nonorth, cov_nonorth),\n    (\"3. Full Partialling-Out DML (5-Fold CF) \", est_dml, cov_dml),\n]:\n    arr = np.array(vals)\n    rmse = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((arr - theta_true) ** 2)))\n    print(f\"{label} | Mean={arr.mean():.4f} | Bias={arr.mean()-theta_true:+.4f} | RMSE={rmse:.4f} | 95% CI Cov={cov/n_reps:5.1%}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Monte Carlo DML (80 Ulangan, n=500, p=30, lam=18, theta_true = +2.00) ===\n1. Direct Plug-in Ridge (Bias O(n^-1/4)) | Mean=2.1931 | Bias=+0.1931 | RMSE=0.1973 | 95% CI Cov= 0.0%\n2. Non-Orthogonal (Y-res saja, tanpa T)  | Mean=0.4607 | Bias=-1.5393 | RMSE=1.5397 | 95% CI Cov= 0.0%\n3. Full Partialling-Out DML (5-Fold CF)  | Mean=2.0219 | Bias=+0.0219 | RMSE=0.0490 | 95% CI Cov=93.8%",
          "actualOutput": "=== Monte Carlo DML (80 Ulangan, n=500, p=30, lam=18, theta_true = +2.00) ===\n1. Direct Plug-in Ridge (Bias O(n^-1/4)) | Mean=2.1931 | Bias=+0.1931 | RMSE=0.1973 | 95% CI Cov= 0.0%\n2. Non-Orthogonal (Y-res saja, tanpa T)  | Mean=0.4607 | Bias=-1.5393 | RMSE=1.5397 | 95% CI Cov= 0.0%\n3. Full Partialling-Out DML (5-Fold CF)  | Mean=2.0219 | Bias=+0.0219 | RMSE=0.0490 | 95% CI Cov=93.8%",
