          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.base import clone\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier, RandomForestRegressor\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import KFold\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(3123)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Audit 1: Bencana Overfitting Bias Tanpa Cross-Fitting pada AIPW-DML (Chernozhukov IRM)\n# Menggunakan RandomForest tak-terpangkas (unpruned) yang IDENTIK di kedua jalur!\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn, p = 1200, 10\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, p))\ne_true = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(1.2 * X[:, 0] - 1.0 * X[:, 1] + 0.8 * (X[:, 2] > 0))))\nT = rng.binomial(1, e_true)\nmu0 = 2.0 * X[:, 0] - 1.5 * X[:, 1] + 2.0 * (X[:, 2] > 0)\nATE_TRUE = 1.50\nY = mu0 + ATE_TRUE * T + rng.normal(0.0, 1.5, size=n)\n\nrf_reg = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=30, max_depth=None, min_samples_leaf=1, random_state=42)\nrf_clf = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=30, max_depth=None, min_samples_leaf=1, random_state=42)\n\n# Jalur A (SALAH!): In-Sample Tanpa Cross-Fitting -> mu_hat menghafal Y_i, e_hat menghafal T_i!\nm1_in = clone(rf_reg).fit(X[T == 1], Y[T == 1]).predict(X)\nm0_in = clone(rf_reg).fit(X[T == 0], Y[T == 0]).predict(X)\ne_in = np.clip(clone(rf_clf).fit(X, T).predict_proba(X)[:, 1], 0.05, 0.95)\npsi_in = (m1_in - m0_in) + T * (Y - m1_in) / e_in - (1 - T) * (Y - m0_in) / (1.0 - e_in)\nate_in, se_in = float(psi_in.mean()), float(psi_in.std(ddof=1) / np.sqrt(n))\nmae_in = float(np.mean(np.abs(Y - np.where(T == 1, m1_in, m0_in))))\n\n# Jalur B (BENAR!): 5-Fold Cross-Fitting dengan RF Unpruned yang 100% IDENTIK!\nkf = KFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\nm1_cf, m0_cf, e_cf = np.empty(n), np.empty(n), np.empty(n)\nfor tr_i, va_i in kf.split(X):\n    m1_cf[va_i] = clone(rf_reg).fit(X[tr_i][T[tr_i] == 1], Y[tr_i][T[tr_i] == 1]).predict(X[va_i])\n    m0_cf[va_i] = clone(rf_reg).fit(X[tr_i][T[tr_i] == 0], Y[tr_i][T[tr_i] == 0]).predict(X[va_i])\n    e_cf[va_i] = np.clip(clone(rf_clf).fit(X[tr_i], T[tr_i]).predict_proba(X[va_i])[:, 1], 0.05, 0.95)\npsi_cf = (m1_cf - m0_cf) + T * (Y - m1_cf) / e_cf - (1 - T) * (Y - m0_cf) / (1.0 - e_cf)\nate_cf, se_cf = float(psi_cf.mean()), float(psi_cf.std(ddof=1) / np.sqrt(n))\nmae_cf = float(np.mean(np.abs(Y - np.where(T == 1, m1_cf, m0_cf))))\n\nprint(f\"=== 1. Audit Overfitting Bias AIPW-DML: Tanpa CF vs 5-Fold CF (True ATE = +{ATE_TRUE:.2f}) ===\")\nprint(f\"RF Unpruned TANPA Cross-Fitting | ATE={ate_in:+.4f} +/- {1.96*se_in:.4f} | Bias={ate_in-ATE_TRUE:+.4f} | Mean|Y-mu|={mae_in:.3f} (HAFAL!)\")\nprint(f\"RF Unpruned DENGAN 5-Fold CF    | ATE={ate_cf:+.4f} +/- {1.96*se_cf:.4f} | Bias={ate_cf-ATE_TRUE:+.4f} | Mean|Y-mu|={mae_cf:.3f} (TAK BIAS!)\")\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Audit 2: Pelanggaran Weak Overlap pada Partialling-Out DML (sigma_V Menciut -> SE Meledak!)\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Weak Overlap: Penyusutan Variasi Independen T Terhadap SE DML (True=+1.50) ===\")\ngx_w = 2.5 * (X[:, 0] > 0.0) - 2.0 * (X[:, 1] > 0.2)\nmx_w = 1.2 * (X[:, 0] > 0.0) - 0.9 * (X[:, 1] > 0.2)\nrf_clean = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=25, max_depth=4, min_samples_leaf=15, random_state=42)\nkf3 = KFold(n_splits=3, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\n\nfor sigma_v in [0.90, 0.30, 0.10]:\n    T_ov = mx_w + rng.normal(0.0, sigma_v, size=n)\n    Y_ov = 1.50 * T_ov + gx_w + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n    yr, tr_r = np.empty(n), np.empty(n)\n    for tr_i, va_i in kf3.split(X):\n        yr[va_i] = Y_ov[va_i] - clone(rf_clean).fit(X[tr_i], Y_ov[tr_i]).predict(X[va_i])\n        tr_r[va_i] = T_ov[va_i] - clone(rf_clean).fit(X[tr_i], T_ov[tr_i]).predict(X[va_i])\n    denom = float(np.sum(tr_r ** 2))\n    th_o = float(np.sum(tr_r * yr) / denom)\n    se_o = float(np.sqrt(np.sum((tr_r * (yr - th_o * tr_r)) ** 2)) / denom)\n    print(f\"sigma_V={sigma_v:.2f} | Var(T_tilde)={np.var(tr_r):.4f} | theta_hat={th_o:+.4f} | SE={se_o:.4f} (CI Width={3.92*se_o:.3f})\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Overfitting Bias AIPW-DML: Tanpa CF vs 5-Fold CF (True ATE = +1.50) ===\nRF Unpruned TANPA Cross-Fitting | ATE=+1.8470 +/- 0.1030 | Bias=+0.3470 | Mean|Y-mu|=0.511 (HAFAL!)\nRF Unpruned DENGAN 5-Fold CF    | ATE=+1.4963 +/- 0.3258 | Bias=-0.0037 | Mean|Y-mu|=1.378 (TAK BIAS!)\n\n=== 2. Audit Weak Overlap: Penyusutan Variasi Independen T Terhadap SE DML (True=+1.50) ===\nsigma_V=0.90 | Var(T_tilde)=0.8522 | theta_hat=+1.5272 | SE=0.0327 (CI Width=0.128)\nsigma_V=0.30 | Var(T_tilde)=0.0996 | theta_hat=+1.4364 | SE=0.0977 (CI Width=0.383)\nsigma_V=0.10 | Var(T_tilde)=0.0129 | theta_hat=+2.1677 | SE=0.3505 (CI Width=1.374)",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Audit Overfitting Bias AIPW-DML: Tanpa CF vs 5-Fold CF (True ATE = +1.50) ===\nRF Unpruned TANPA Cross-Fitting | ATE=+1.8470 +/- 0.1030 | Bias=+0.3470 | Mean|Y-mu|=0.511 (HAFAL!)\nRF Unpruned DENGAN 5-Fold CF    | ATE=+1.4963 +/- 0.3258 | Bias=-0.0037 | Mean|Y-mu|=1.378 (TAK BIAS!)\n\n=== 2. Audit Weak Overlap: Penyusutan Variasi Independen T Terhadap SE DML (True=+1.50) ===\nsigma_V=0.90 | Var(T_tilde)=0.8522 | theta_hat=+1.5272 | SE=0.0327 (CI Width=0.128)\nsigma_V=0.30 | Var(T_tilde)=0.0996 | theta_hat=+1.4364 | SE=0.0977 (CI Width=0.383)\nsigma_V=0.10 | Var(T_tilde)=0.0129 | theta_hat=+2.1677 | SE=0.3505 (CI Width=1.374)",
