          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef partialling_out_dml_ridge(X, T, Y, lam: float = 15.0, n_folds: int = 5) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n    # TODO: 5-fold cross-fitting Ridge untuk Y & T -> hitung y_res, t_res -> theta_hat, sandwich se_hat, ci_width\n    pass\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(19)\nn, p = 600, 12\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, p))\nT = X @ np.linspace(1.0, 0.2, p) + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\nY = 3.0 * T + X @ np.linspace(1.2, 0.3, p) + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\nprint(partialling_out_dml_ridge(X, T, Y, lam=15.0, n_folds=5))",
