          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.stats import spearmanr\nfrom sklearn.base import clone\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingRegressor, RandomForestRegressor\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import KFold\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(3132)\nn_tr, n_te, p = 1800, 800, 8\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Scikit-Learn 1.9: Implementasi Penuh S, T, X (Kunzel 2019) & R-Learner (Nie-Wager)\n# Kondisi Treatment Sangat Timpang (~11% Treatment vs ~89% Kontrol) dengan\n# baseline mu_0(X) kompleks non-linier dan fungsi CATE tau(X) halus!\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\ndef generate_data(n: int, rng_obj):\n    X = rng_obj.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, p))\n    mu0 = 3.0 * np.sin(X[:, 0]) + 1.5 * (X[:, 1] ** 2) - 2.0 * X[:, 2] + 1.2 * X[:, 3] * X[:, 4]\n    tau = 1.6 * X[:, 0] - 0.9 * X[:, 1] + 0.5\n    logits = -2.25 + 0.45 * X[:, 2]\n    e = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-logits))\n    T = rng_obj.binomial(1, e)\n    Y = mu0 + T * tau + rng_obj.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n    return X, T, Y, tau\n\nX_tr, T_tr, Y_tr, _ = generate_data(n_tr, rng)\nX_te, _, _, tau_te = generate_data(n_te, rng)\n\nbase_mu = HistGradientBoostingRegressor(max_depth=4, max_iter=45, max_bins=64, min_samples_leaf=20, random_state=42)\nbase_tau = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=40, max_depth=5, min_samples_leaf=15, random_state=42)\n\n# 1. S-Learner (Single Model)\ns_mod = clone(base_mu).fit(np.column_stack([X_tr, T_tr]), Y_tr)\ntau_s = s_mod.predict(np.column_stack([X_te, np.ones(n_te)])) - s_mod.predict(np.column_stack([X_te, np.zeros(n_te)]))\n\n# 2. T-Learner (Two Separate Models)\nmu0_mod = clone(base_mu).fit(X_tr[T_tr == 0], Y_tr[T_tr == 0])\nmu1_mod = clone(base_mu).fit(X_tr[T_tr == 1], Y_tr[T_tr == 1])\ntau_t = mu1_mod.predict(X_te) - mu0_mod.predict(X_te)\n\n# 3. X-Learner (Kunzel et al., PNAS 2019 — 3 Tahap dengan Imputed CATE & Propensity Weight)\nD1 = Y_tr[T_tr == 1] - mu0_mod.predict(X_tr[T_tr == 1])\nD0 = mu1_mod.predict(X_tr[T_tr == 0]) - Y_tr[T_tr == 0]\ntau1_mod = clone(base_tau).fit(X_tr[T_tr == 1], D1)\ntau0_mod = clone(base_tau).fit(X_tr[T_tr == 0], D0)\nprop_mod = LogisticRegression(max_iter=300).fit(X_tr, T_tr)\ng_te = np.clip(prop_mod.predict_proba(X_te)[:, 1], 0.02, 0.98)\ntau_x = g_te * tau0_mod.predict(X_te) + (1.0 - g_te) * tau1_mod.predict(X_te)\n\n# 4. R-Learner (Nie & Wager — 4-Fold Cross-Fitted Robinson Transformation + Weighted Regression)\nkf = KFold(n_splits=4, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\nm_oof, e_oof = np.empty(n_tr), np.empty(n_tr)\nfor tr_i, va_i in kf.split(X_tr):\n    m_oof[va_i] = clone(base_mu).fit(X_tr[tr_i], Y_tr[tr_i]).predict(X_tr[va_i])\n    e_oof[va_i] = LogisticRegression(max_iter=300).fit(X_tr[tr_i], T_tr[tr_i]).predict_proba(X_tr[va_i])[:, 1]\ny_res, t_res = Y_tr - m_oof, T_tr - e_oof\nmask_safe = np.abs(t_res) > 0.03\nr_mod = clone(base_tau).fit(X_tr[mask_safe], y_res[mask_safe] / t_res[mask_safe], sample_weight=t_res[mask_safe] ** 2)\ntau_r = r_mod.predict(X_te)\n\nprint(f\"=== Benchmark Meta-Learners pada Treatment Timpang (T=1: {T_tr.mean():.1%}, n_tr={n_tr}, n_te={n_te}) ===\")\nfor name, pred in [\n    (\"S-Learner (Single HistGBDT) \", tau_s),\n    (\"T-Learner (Dual HistGBDT)   \", tau_t),\n    (\"X-Learner (Kunzel PNAS 2019)\", tau_x),\n    (\"R-Learner (Nie-Wager CrossF)\", tau_r),\n]:\n    pehe = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((pred - tau_te) ** 2)))\n    rho = float(spearmanr(pred, tau_te).statistic)\n    print(f\"{name} | PEHE={pehe:.4f} | Spearman={rho:.4f} | Mean tau_hat={pred.mean():+.3f} (True={tau_te.mean():+.3f})\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Benchmark Meta-Learners pada Treatment Timpang (T=1: 11.0%, n_tr=1800, n_te=800) ===\nS-Learner (Single HistGBDT)  | PEHE=1.2305 | Spearman=0.9348 | Mean tau_hat=+0.170 (True=+0.447)\nT-Learner (Dual HistGBDT)    | PEHE=1.5721 | Spearman=0.7754 | Mean tau_hat=+0.192 (True=+0.447)\nX-Learner (Kunzel PNAS 2019) | PEHE=0.7702 | Spearman=0.9362 | Mean tau_hat=+0.425 (True=+0.447)\nR-Learner (Nie-Wager CrossF) | PEHE=0.7119 | Spearman=0.9417 | Mean tau_hat=+0.495 (True=+0.447)",
          "actualOutput": "=== Benchmark Meta-Learners pada Treatment Timpang (T=1: 11.0%, n_tr=1800, n_te=800) ===\nS-Learner (Single HistGBDT)  | PEHE=1.2305 | Spearman=0.9348 | Mean tau_hat=+0.170 (True=+0.447)\nT-Learner (Dual HistGBDT)    | PEHE=1.5721 | Spearman=0.7754 | Mean tau_hat=+0.192 (True=+0.447)\nX-Learner (Kunzel PNAS 2019) | PEHE=0.7702 | Spearman=0.9362 | Mean tau_hat=+0.425 (True=+0.447)\nR-Learner (Nie-Wager CrossF) | PEHE=0.7119 | Spearman=0.9417 | Mean tau_hat=+0.495 (True=+0.447)",
